<%- include('header') %>

<div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <!-- Page Header Banner -->
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-header) 0%, #2c1044 100%); color: #fff; padding: 25px 30px; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary-green); box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
            <div>
                <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                    <span style="color: var(--primary-green);"><i data-lucide="refresh-cw"></i></span> Refund & Escrow Policy
                </h1>
                <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #cbd5e1;">Comprehensive buyer reimbursement, claim procedures, and warranty terms</p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); border: 1px solid var(--primary-green); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #86efac; font-weight: bold;">
                Protection: <span><i data-lucide="shield-check" style="width:14px;height:14px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px;"></i>100% Escrow Guaranteed</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Main Content Panel -->
    <div style="background: #fff; padding: 35px 40px; border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); color: #333; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;">
        
        <!-- Crucial Notice Box -->
        <div style="background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-green); padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 13px; color: #166534;">
            <strong style="color: #14532d; font-size: 14px;"><i data-lucide="shield" style="width:16px;height:16px;vertical-align:middle;"></i> Escrow Rule #1:</strong> Never click "Release Escrow & Review" until you have thoroughly tested and verified the digital assets received. Once escrow is released to the seller, funds are final and cannot be automatically reversed.
        </div>

        <!-- Section 1: Eligibility -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="color: var(--primary-green);">1.</span> Refund Eligibility Criteria
            </h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; color: #475569;">
                Buyers are entitled to a replacement or full refund under the following conditions:
            </p>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-top: 15px;">
                <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; color: #dc2626; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 13px;"><i data-lucide="x-circle" style="width:16px;height:16px;vertical-align:middle;"></i> Dead / Invalid Cards</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Virtual cards or accounts that are non-functional, expired, or balance-depleted on arrival.</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; color: #d97706; margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 13px;"><i data-lucide="package" style="width:16px;height:16px;vertical-align:middle;"></i> Non-Delivery</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Orders where the vendor failed to provide the ordered credentials within the designated delivery window.</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary-purple); margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 13px;"><i data-lucide="alert-triangle" style="width:16px;height:16px;vertical-align:middle;"></i> Material Misrepresentation</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Items that significantly differ from the listing description, balance, or specifications.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2: Process -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="color: var(--primary-green);">2.</span> Step-by-Step Refund Process
            </h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; color: #475569;">
                Follow these precise steps if an issue arises with your order:
            </p>
            <ol style="padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <strong style="color: #1e293b;">Step 1 — Immediate Direct Contact:</strong> Send an encrypted direct message to the vendor via the <a href="/messages" style="color: var(--primary-purple); font-weight: bold;">Messages Portal</a> explaining the discrepancy. Many sellers provide replacement credentials immediately.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <strong style="color: #1e293b;">Step 2 — Preserve Evidence:</strong> Take clear screenshots, video recordings of first-time login attempts, or balance validation receipts.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <strong style="color: #1e293b;">Step 3 — Escalate to Support:</strong> If the seller is unresponsive within 24 hours or refuses a valid claim, open a support ticket under the "Escrow Department" on our <a href="/support" style="color: var(--primary-purple); font-weight: bold;">Support Page</a>.
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <strong style="color: #1e293b;">Step 4 — Administrative Review:</strong> TorMart mediators will freeze the escrow timer, assess the logs and proof, and rule in favor of the rightful party.
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 3: Timeframes -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="color: var(--primary-green);">3.</span> Escrow & Dispute Timeframes
            </h3>
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background: #f8fafc; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);">
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #334155; font-size: 12px;">Product Category</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #334155; font-size: 12px;">Standard Escrow Timer</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #334155; font-size: 12px;">Dispute Window</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b;">Virtual Cards / CCs</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: #475569;">24 Hours</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: bold;">Within 24 Hours</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b;">Digital Accounts / Transfers</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: #475569;">48 Hours</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: bold;">Within 48 Hours</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b;">Custom Services / Documents</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: #475569;">72 Hours</td>
                        <td style="padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--primary-green); font-weight: bold;">Within 72 Hours</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 4: Escrow Protection -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 35px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="color: var(--primary-green);">4.</span> Escrow Protection Mechanics
            </h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; color: #475569;">
                TorMart's automated smart escrow acts as an impartial vault:
            </p>
            <ul style="padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Funds deposited for an order are completely unreachable by the vendor until you confirm completion or the dispute period elapses.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">When a dispute is active, the auto-release timer is indefinitely halted until administration concludes arbitration.</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Approved refunds are credited directly back to the buyer's balance or refunded to the deposit wallet.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 5: Dispute Resolution -->
        <div>
            <h3 style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span style="color: var(--primary-green);">5.</span> Dispute Resolution & Staff Arbitration
            </h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
                Our dispute mediators evaluate each case strictly on documented evidence. Both buyers and vendors are held to stringent honesty standards. Any vendor engaging in fraudulent listing descriptions or deceptive delivery will suffer full refund debiting and vendor bond forfeiture.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="/support" class="btn btn-green" style="font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 20px;">Open Dispute via Support</a>
                <a href="/dashboard" class="btn" style="background: #334155; color: white; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 20px;">Check My Active Orders</a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<%- include('footer') %>
